# Build context is the repository root; send only what the Dockerfile uses.
*
!bin/
!src/
!tests/
!docs/openapi.yaml
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock

# Files that change without changing the build; they would otherwise
# invalidate the cache of `COPY tests` and `COPY src/...` layers.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
